                    {
                        "form_id": "b48258f5-ae98-4351-8482-d41616d7293d",
                        "entry_id": "bca2d1f8-b0d6-34fa-9fae-e7da4af237f9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ри́зах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f58e2ce5-1c6b-3fac-a2f9-135a4bc79e51",
                        "entry_id": "bca2d1f8-b0d6-34fa-9fae-e7da4af237f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. верхнее облачение священника при богослужении"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c19c4342-b975-42ea-8952-e1a2351ab5b7",
                                "sense_id": "f58e2ce5-1c6b-3fac-a2f9-135a4bc79e51",
                                "text": "В ту минуту, как Карл Иваныч отворил дверь залы, священник надевал ризу и раздались первые звуки молебна."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e7309a3a-81e3-32b7-9d34-2df6eb0551f9",
                        "entry_id": "bca2d1f8-b0d6-34fa-9fae-e7da4af237f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. согласно евангелию — одежды Христа"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "196d5fa1-0b1c-3e19-a327-d8e8a41d0f26",
                        "entry_id": "bca2d1f8-b0d6-34fa-9fae-e7da4af237f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. парадное, богато украшенное царское одеяние в Древней Руси"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "70cf3e92-7262-4029-804e-955c6bde5bb6",
                                "sense_id": "196d5fa1-0b1c-3e19-a327-d8e8a41d0f26",
                                "text": "И осужденному поднес венец богатый, // И ризою облек из жемчуга и злата, // И бармы возложил, и сам на свой престол // По шелковым коврам виновного возвел."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4369675f-8aed-31b8-aa60-e81db3443078",
                        "entry_id": "bca2d1f8-b0d6-34fa-9fae-e7da4af237f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. металлическая обшивка, оклад на иконе"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34385375-3704-4cac-a7d9-60965421c4e3",
                                "sense_id": "4369675f-8aed-31b8-aa60-e81db3443078",
                                "text": "Лампады ярко сверкали своими огнями на золотых ризах и драгоценных каменьях образов. Из-под блестящих окладов тускло выглядывали лики святых."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf20d341-38ea-49c3-a63a-bdafd2363da2",
                        "source_entry_id": "bca2d1f8-b0d6-34fa-9fae-e7da4af237f9",
                        "source_sense_description": "облачение священника",
                        "target_lang_word": "chasuble",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chasuble",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "528de6b5-535c-3f17-a0f8-ce2574f33f5e",
                                        "entry_id": "87505349-4fbf-3301-a378-8563f4cfb8f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The outermost liturgical vestment worn by clergy for celebrating Eucharist or Mass."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cab7c5f3-a1c4-4dcc-ac8a-e19166923337",
                                                "sense_id": "528de6b5-535c-3f17-a0f8-ce2574f33f5e",
                                                "text": "Day broke. He saw three black hens asleep in a tree. He shuddered, horrified at this omen. Then he promised the Holy Virgin three chasubles for the church, and that he would go barefooted from the cemetery at Bertaux to the chapel of Vassonville."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c2a9771-9f6c-42c4-97d3-196b339a76e5",
                                                "sense_id": "528de6b5-535c-3f17-a0f8-ce2574f33f5e",
                                                "text": "He has magenta eyes, like old-fashioned vest buttons; he’s mowsy and glaubrous, brown like arnica and then green as the Nile; he’s quaky and qualmy and queasy and teasy; he chews chasubles and ripples rasubly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": [
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "4ad9937c-da9d-4e07-83fd-488806861a90",
                        "source_entry_id": "bca2d1f8-b0d6-34fa-9fae-e7da4af237f9",
